          <li><a href="#">Apply for a mail-in ballot</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Election results and statistics</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Become an election worker</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Political party registration</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Electoral district maps</a></li>
